    <sys:String x:Key="LOCPlayAch_Settings_IconScaleMode_Help">How art sizes in resizable grid columns, such as the achievement icon, category and game columns, the Overview game list and the Manage Achievements editor. Stretch to fill grows art to fill the cell; Up to own size grows it no larger than its own pixel size. Both shrink art to fit a narrower column.</sys:String>
